<title>COLOMBIA: TABLE - Colombia's Cadenalco first half net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Colombia's Cadenalco first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			    1996</p>
<p>Net		 6.93 billion		  5.26 billion</p>
<p>Oper revs     413.73 billion		354.96 billion</p>
<p>Assets	  594.92 billion		438.92 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos.</p>
<p>Results subject to verification by Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>Cadenalco is a supermarket chain.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota Newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
